  "_caveats": [
    "Every figure is transcribed from a signed BLGF eSRE filing and reconciled: local and external sources sum to total income, the four expenditure buckets sum to total current operating expenditure, and income less expenditure equals net operating income.",
    "Figures follow the Total column of each statement, which combines the General Fund, the Special Education Fund and the Trust Fund for the whole provincial government.",
    "Filings are year-to-date cumulative from 1 January. Q2 2021 therefore covers January to June 2021 and is not a stand-alone April to June figure.",
    "The Q4 filing of each year states the full-year position and is published here as FY of that year with the range Jan - Dec.",
    "Expenditure buckets group the statement functional classification. Social services is Education, Culture & Sports plus Health, Nutrition & Population Control plus Labor and Employment plus Housing and Community Development plus Social Services and Social Welfare. Debt service is interest expense and other charges only, because loan principal is a non-operating expenditure and sits outside the operating totals.",
    "Amounts are rounded to two decimal places of a million. Components are adjusted by at most 0.01 M so that the published breakdowns sum exactly to the published totals.",
    "The most recent statement the province has published is Q2 2021. No later filing exists, so this dashboard does not extend beyond it."
  ],
